	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『宇宙戦艦ヤマト2202』に登場のガミラス艦「クリピテラ級」「ケルカピア級」「デストリア級」の3体セットが1/1000スケールで！",
			"• 精密なディテールでガミラス艦を再現！",
			"• 艦首両舷開口部は、クリアパーツと水転写式デカールで発光を再現。",
			"• 航行時の再現ができる蛍光色パーツと停泊時が再現できるパーツの2種が付属。",
			"• ディスプレイベース用の艦名シールが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"A 1/1000 Scale set of three Garmillas ships \"Kripitera class\", \"Kelucapia class\" and \"Destria class\" that appeared in \"Space Battleship Yamato 2202\"!",
			"• Reproduce the Garmillas ship with precise details!",
			"• The openings on both sides of the bow reproduce light emission using clear parts and water transfer decals.",
			"• Two types of parts are included: fluorescent colored parts that can reproduce when sailing and parts that can reproduce when anchored.",
			"• Includes ship name seal for display base."
		]
